==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Bidoof|171}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Kalos Starter Set|Bidoof|29}} from the {{TCG|Kalos Starter Set}}.
*{{m|Headbutt}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Bidoof}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Brilliant Diamond}}.

